  "reviewed_contracts": [
    "numeric input defval becomes const only for input.int/input.float v5/v6; input.source and other versions untouched",
    "one effective parameter bound shared by body/default checks, callable inference and consumer binder; AST explicit qualifier unchanged",
    "eligible typed value parameters default series and only narrow to simple through resolved body constraints",
    "reference and UDT parameters excluded from narrowing; explicit qualifiers remain authoritative",
    "finite worklist propagates declaration requirements beyond16 helpers; ordinary signature resolver owns arguments/type matches",
    "lexical initializer aliases and shadows handled; normal validation retains rejection of remaining series and const/input requirements"
  ],
